  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive analysis of the Rabat-Sal&#xE9;-K&#xE9;nitra region for collaborative initiatives with Dutch companies in horticulture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protected horticultural production is one of the most important economic activities of the region of K&#xE9;nitra, Morocco. Conditions are particularly favourable to tomato production but the region faces constraints that limit sustainable growth.This project furthermore identifies local specificities in the horticultural sector in the K&#xE9;nitra-Rabat-Sal&#xE9; area. This information will be integrated in the combi-track in Morocco.</narrative>
  </description>
